# Firoz Mahmud Portfolio — Cursor AI Context

**Before any edit, read `/AGENTS.md` in the repo root** for complete architecture, design system, content rules, and session decisions.

## Non-negotiables

1. **Content source**: `src/data/content.ts` — never invent resume facts
2. **Display role**: Senior Software Engineer (Forward Deployed AI only in `availability` text)
3. **Font**: Inter only
4. **Layout**: use `.page-container` — no nested `px-*` + `max-w-*` stacking
5. **Nav scroll-spy**: use `src/hooks/useActiveSection.ts` — not IntersectionObserver
6. **Theme**: `localStorage` key `portfolio-theme`; system preference on first visit
7. **Reduced motion**: use `useReducedMotion()` for animations
8. **Lenis**: smooth scroll via `window.__lenis`; BackToTop uses it for scroll-to-top
9. **Commits**: only when user explicitly requests

## Key paths

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| All content | `src/data/content.ts` |
| Design tokens | `src/index.css` |
| Section order | `src/pages/HomePage.tsx` |
| 3D hero | `src/components/three/HeroScene.tsx` |
